          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لوری (lorī) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin lorī under lōḍa, \"tossing, swinging\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 11136): the song of the rocking cradle."
